WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:05.320
~izu presents~

00:00.350 --> 00:05.320
Papa to Kiss in the Dark
Episode 2

00:10.780 --> 00:13.930
I'm not Kyosuke's son...

00:16.470 --> 00:18.300
That I was adopted...

00:20.170 --> 00:21.570
It can't be...

00:25.840 --> 00:27.610
I beg you, Mira.

00:30.450 --> 00:32.850
Please don't be down
with a face like that.

00:32.920 --> 00:33.400
What?

00:46.560 --> 00:48.890
Even if you don't have
a blood relation...

00:49.100 --> 00:51.260
...Kyosuke-san is still your papa.

00:57.070 --> 00:58.300
And I too...

00:59.340 --> 01:00.240
Kazu?

01:02.850 --> 01:04.810
Hey, what happened to you?

01:08.420 --> 01:09.680
I love you.

01:13.090 --> 01:16.530
If my lover was Kazu,
then would I have...

01:17.760 --> 01:20.490
...not had to suffer like now?

01:22.060 --> 01:22.890
Mira.

01:24.230 --> 01:25.700
You are so cute.

01:29.010 --> 01:32.630
But my body doesn't tremble
like the times with Kyosuke.

01:33.110 --> 01:36.480
Is this because we are not related?

01:43.950 --> 01:46.150
I thought our relation was something...

01:46.290 --> 01:49.750
...that was born from
the deep and strong bond...

01:50.290 --> 01:51.950
...as related family.

01:52.400 --> 01:55.090
Was this just my own assumption?

02:00.100 --> 02:01.430
Kyosuke!

02:18.020 --> 02:20.720
It's frustrating but
they look great together.

02:20.820 --> 02:23.290
When are those two going to get
married?

02:23.630 --> 02:27.080
I want to become Mizuki Utsunomiya!

02:32.870 --> 02:35.300
Okay, we are going to
start the main take!

02:42.250 --> 02:44.300
So I was right about it.

02:44.650 --> 02:45.170
What?

02:47.320 --> 02:49.310
I was kind of aware of that...

02:49.990 --> 02:54.320
...you and him were doing
a lot of stuff together.

02:58.030 --> 03:01.220
Because you keep on getting
more attractive, and...

03:01.460 --> 03:06.300
...when we were changing for gym class,
I saw some love marks on you.

03:09.170 --> 03:12.370
But because you guys are family...

03:12.540 --> 03:16.600
...I had underrated saying
nothing was going to happen.

03:18.950 --> 03:25.550
Since today I found out you guys
were not related, I made my decision!

03:26.120 --> 03:28.060
A-about what?

03:28.620 --> 03:31.650
I nominate myself! To become your lover!

03:32.230 --> 03:33.090
Wa...

03:34.530 --> 03:36.230
Wait a second!

03:37.100 --> 03:39.530
We are childhood friends
and close friends.

03:39.740 --> 03:42.670
We aren't in a relationship to
do something like this, right?

03:45.440 --> 03:47.030
So right now...

03:47.410 --> 03:51.010
If you say not right now,
then when is it okay?

03:53.320 --> 03:55.250
How long do I have to wait?

03:55.350 --> 03:56.910
T-that's...

04:00.320 --> 04:01.380
I know.

04:04.530 --> 04:06.320
I waited this long...

04:06.900 --> 04:08.860
I can wait a little longer.

04:10.600 --> 04:11.590
I'm sorry.

04:25.550 --> 04:28.540
Waiting is hard...

04:36.390 --> 04:37.320
Kyosuke...

04:38.090 --> 04:40.590
What should I do?

04:54.080 --> 04:57.140
If you are sleeping in a place
like this, you will catch a cold.

05:01.220 --> 05:03.850
It was okay if you were
in bed ahead of me.

05:08.860 --> 05:11.160
You were pretty late today, huh?

05:11.330 --> 05:11.790
Yeah.

05:12.500 --> 05:15.730
After work, I was seeing someone.

05:15.930 --> 05:16.800
Really...

05:17.830 --> 05:22.790
I worried about this alone and
you're on a date with someone?

05:26.580 --> 05:27.510
No...

05:28.440 --> 05:30.810
I was with Kazu too...

05:32.880 --> 05:33.810
But...

05:34.720 --> 05:37.020
...I have to make things clear now!

05:37.520 --> 05:39.010
U-um...

05:39.620 --> 05:40.320
Huh?

05:40.890 --> 05:43.050
It's about the family registry...

05:43.160 --> 05:45.150
Yeah, about the copy, right?

05:45.660 --> 05:50.120
About that, I submitted it the
day of the enrollment ceremony.

05:50.230 --> 05:51.560
What? Is that so?

05:54.370 --> 05:55.800
What the hell?

05:56.770 --> 05:59.760
Then I can't talk and ask questions...

06:04.180 --> 06:08.840
Normally, you would be worried
thinking who your real parent is.

06:10.250 --> 06:14.090
But what concerns me the most is...

06:17.730 --> 06:18.750
Kyosuke...

06:19.160 --> 06:19.890
Hmm?

06:27.800 --> 06:29.740
What am l...

06:30.210 --> 06:31.400
...to Kyosuke?

06:34.140 --> 06:34.940
Mira!

06:36.980 --> 06:38.670
What's the matter?

06:39.680 --> 06:42.780
Being left alone at home
made you lonely?

06:43.120 --> 06:44.310
I wasn't...

06:44.490 --> 06:47.080
Of course I wasn't lonely...

06:49.260 --> 06:52.750
Then, why is this little boy crying?

07:04.210 --> 07:07.180
I just came home and
you are so passionate...

07:07.340 --> 07:09.370
Please...please...

07:10.480 --> 07:12.880
What are you asking for?

07:13.320 --> 07:14.870
Don't leave me...

07:15.020 --> 07:19.420
I...I am not going to be okay
if you are not with me, Kyosuke.

07:19.620 --> 07:21.090
It's okay.

07:21.520 --> 07:24.120
So wasteful to abandon...

07:25.330 --> 07:27.260
Kyosuke, Kyosuke...

07:27.500 --> 07:28.830
I love you!

07:38.840 --> 07:42.540
After all, this is
just a normal "love"...

07:43.480 --> 07:47.380
Regardless of the fact if I'm related
or not related to him, I'm in...

07:48.080 --> 07:49.780
...Love with Kyosuke.

07:51.750 --> 07:53.880
It's hidden, right?

07:55.590 --> 07:57.580
Man, my bad...

07:57.960 --> 08:01.730
Thanks to Kyosuke, once again
I am this bright and lively this morning.

08:03.670 --> 08:04.530
Okay!

08:05.630 --> 08:06.620
Let's go!

08:08.340 --> 08:09.240
Hey Mira...

08:10.070 --> 08:13.470
Is it true that Papa-san is going to
get married with Mizuki Utsunomiya?

08:13.540 --> 08:14.200
What?

08:14.510 --> 08:16.810
Well, recently everyone is
talking about it, you know?

08:17.650 --> 08:21.310
To tell you the truth,
I saw them at the TV station.

08:22.150 --> 08:25.280
Those two had this out of
the ordinary ambience...

08:25.650 --> 08:28.620
Their marriage is just a rumor...

08:29.020 --> 08:31.080
Oh, is that true? I thought it was...

08:31.330 --> 08:31.790
Shun!

08:33.900 --> 08:37.300
You're right. It's most likely
my misunderstanding.

08:37.470 --> 08:39.300
Well, I'll see you later!

08:41.940 --> 08:43.170
Don't worry about it.

08:43.240 --> 08:43.830
Yeah.

08:46.180 --> 08:48.700
More than that, it's about
yesterday's answer...

08:48.810 --> 08:51.680
If it's about that, you don't
have to tell me for a while.

08:53.620 --> 08:55.310
Um, Kazu, l...

08:55.420 --> 09:00.380
By the way, my mom has gone
totally crazy for Kyosuke-san.

09:00.860 --> 09:03.190
Remember, at the parents get-together?

09:03.290 --> 09:03.920
What?

09:05.390 --> 09:08.960
I didn't know that the
parents get-together was true.

09:09.370 --> 09:12.100
She said the scenery from
the hotel was beautiful...

09:12.200 --> 09:12.930
What?

09:13.240 --> 09:16.430
Why was your mom there with Kyosuke?

09:16.540 --> 09:18.510
What are you getting angry for?

09:18.610 --> 09:22.170
The hall for the parents get-together
was the hotel in bayside!

09:22.810 --> 09:24.900
I-I'm sorry...

09:26.220 --> 09:30.910
Or better yet, if our parents get
together, then we'll be brothers.

09:31.050 --> 09:31.680
Huh?

09:32.150 --> 09:33.450
Meaning...

09:34.120 --> 09:36.820
...if your papa and
my mom get married...

09:36.960 --> 09:40.260
...we can live together without
being bothered by anyone else.

09:42.460 --> 09:46.420
Having nice parents and
a sibling who get along...

09:46.800 --> 09:48.460
An ordinary family...

09:49.100 --> 09:53.560
I just thought for a little that
I wish something like that happened.

09:54.840 --> 09:56.500
I'm sorry, Kazu.

09:56.810 --> 09:57.570
It's fine.

09:58.050 --> 09:59.640
It's not your fault.

10:03.050 --> 10:05.080
Good morning, Lost kitten.

10:06.890 --> 10:08.450
Utsunomiya senpai!

10:08.560 --> 10:10.290
Good morning!

10:10.530 --> 10:12.930
Does it seem like you can
blend in with the new class?

10:13.030 --> 10:13.650
Yes!

10:14.060 --> 10:17.060
Luckily, I'm in the same class
as my childhood friend.

10:21.040 --> 10:21.800
Kazu...

10:22.300 --> 10:25.470
Oh, this is my
childhood friend Kazuki Hino.

10:26.080 --> 10:29.170
Kazu, this is Utsunomiya senpai.
He's the student council president.

10:29.410 --> 10:30.610
Nice to meet you.

10:33.620 --> 10:35.810
Oh no!

10:37.450 --> 10:39.550
Well, Mira, I'll see you later.

10:40.690 --> 10:44.060
You can come visit the student
council room whenever you want.

10:44.160 --> 10:45.350
Ah, Yes...

10:54.270 --> 10:56.570
What's wrong? It's so not you...

10:56.710 --> 10:58.400
Don't go near him anymore.

10:58.510 --> 10:59.440
Why not?

11:00.240 --> 11:04.040
He helped me at the enrollment
ceremony and he's a nice good person.

11:04.380 --> 11:06.040
He's after you.

11:06.520 --> 11:07.450
After what?

11:08.080 --> 11:09.640
Are you an idiot?

11:10.490 --> 11:10.620
Idiot? Idiot?

11:10.620 --> 11:12.520
Idiot? Idiot?
He looks at you like he wants to eat you
up.

11:12.520 --> 11:13.650
He looks at you like he wants to eat you
up.

11:13.760 --> 11:15.520
Ha? I don't think so!

11:15.720 --> 11:17.620
He's good at acting.

11:17.830 --> 11:19.320
That's because he's...

11:19.500 --> 11:22.360
...the son of the great
actress Mizuki Utsunomiya.

11:22.460 --> 11:23.020
What?

11:25.070 --> 11:27.430
The woman's son?

11:48.090 --> 11:51.860
Just because he's the son of an
actress doesn't make him good at acting.

11:51.960 --> 11:55.860
But the way he looked at you...
His ulterior motives were totally clear.

11:56.270 --> 11:57.250
Who cares?

11:57.430 --> 11:59.230
It's not like I'm a virgin.

11:59.900 --> 12:00.600
Mira!

12:01.700 --> 12:02.860
I'm sorry.

12:06.880 --> 12:08.340
That looks delicious...

12:08.440 --> 12:10.780
It's delicious! Because I made it.

12:11.910 --> 12:12.570
Here.

12:21.360 --> 12:22.980
Delicious! It's awesome!

12:23.160 --> 12:23.920
Right?

12:24.090 --> 12:27.120
You will seriously become a great wife!

12:27.230 --> 12:29.990
Right, right? Good cook and good in bed!

12:32.670 --> 12:33.460
Mira!

12:34.700 --> 12:35.570
Mira!

12:36.410 --> 12:38.000
The teacher is calling you!

12:38.170 --> 12:38.760
Huh?

12:41.110 --> 12:42.370
Papa-san was...

12:43.180 --> 12:45.170
Kyosuke-san was in an accident!

13:04.900 --> 13:06.270
No way...

13:08.200 --> 13:09.300
It's a lie!

13:09.810 --> 13:10.790
No!

13:11.410 --> 13:13.870
You said that you wouldn't
leave me alone!

13:13.980 --> 13:14.840
Why...

13:15.140 --> 13:17.200
No!

13:19.180 --> 13:20.580
No, let go!

13:20.680 --> 13:23.010
I'm going to die with Kyosuke too!

13:23.650 --> 13:25.450
Hey, if you shake him that much...

13:25.450 --> 13:26.820
Hey, if you shake him that much...
No!

13:26.920 --> 13:27.480
Mira...

13:27.590 --> 13:27.920
Kyosuke...

13:27.920 --> 13:28.590
Kyosuke...
It's okay, calm down.

13:28.590 --> 13:29.090
It's okay, calm down.

13:29.090 --> 13:30.090
Kyosuke!
It's okay, calm down.

13:30.090 --> 13:31.060
Kyosuke!

13:31.160 --> 13:33.090
Kyosuke is still alive.

13:34.230 --> 13:35.090
Mira...

13:38.800 --> 13:41.770
You have to be quieter in a hospital...

13:42.100 --> 13:43.090
Kyosuke!

13:44.010 --> 13:47.130
I'm happy you are
worried about me, but...

13:47.440 --> 13:48.100
Right?

13:55.680 --> 13:57.150
It's warm...

14:01.260 --> 14:02.590
Be glad...

14:02.890 --> 14:04.980
Thankfully it was only a light injury...

14:05.290 --> 14:07.630
...so he will be able to
get out in 2 to 3 days.

14:08.200 --> 14:09.260
Hojo-san...

14:12.700 --> 14:13.530
Come on.

14:14.040 --> 14:16.370
Let's let Kyosuke rest.

14:16.740 --> 14:17.530
Yes.

14:20.340 --> 14:24.540
I heard that he didn't use a stunt man
since it wasn't that dangerous.

14:25.710 --> 14:28.480
But apparently there was
some kind of miscommunication...

14:28.620 --> 14:30.210
Are you serious?

14:30.850 --> 14:35.020
Kyosuke should take advantage
of this time and take a rest.

14:35.590 --> 14:38.960
I told him until late last night
that he's been working too much.

14:39.360 --> 14:40.920
Last night...

14:42.400 --> 14:45.330
Then last night Kyosuke was late
because he was with...

14:45.400 --> 14:47.230
...the president of the agency.

14:47.940 --> 14:48.630
Mira?

14:48.770 --> 14:51.800
Um... I totally thought
he was on a date...

14:51.910 --> 14:52.700
Oh...

14:53.440 --> 14:56.280
He pretends like he is
horsing around all the time...

14:57.110 --> 14:58.100
Pretends?

14:58.410 --> 15:02.540
If you are fooled by it, then no wonder
everyone else gets fooled.

15:04.450 --> 15:06.390
Pretending to be a playboy.

15:06.560 --> 15:09.250
He's been an honest man
since back in the day.

15:09.420 --> 15:10.690
Are you serious?

15:12.160 --> 15:16.220
Poor guy. Even his beloved Mira
has misunderstood him.

15:17.770 --> 15:20.890
I tried to convince him
many times that it's impossible...

15:21.200 --> 15:23.230
...to raise you alone.

15:25.110 --> 15:28.340
But he said he would raise you
and wouldn't listen to me.

15:28.440 --> 15:31.670
Man, I need to take my hat off for him.

15:33.620 --> 15:36.780
You are really important to Kyosuke.

15:37.690 --> 15:40.990
So I want you to take care of him too.

15:44.430 --> 15:47.220
I'm glad you grew up
to be a very good boy.

15:48.100 --> 15:53.190
He always talks about how
you are so cute and brags about you.

15:55.900 --> 15:57.500
Brags about me?

15:57.640 --> 16:00.570
How much does he know about us?

16:01.710 --> 16:05.650
Do you know why Kyosuke took me in?

16:06.680 --> 16:07.310
What?

16:07.920 --> 16:09.250
What are you talking about?

16:09.550 --> 16:11.490
No, it's nothing.

16:13.220 --> 16:14.310
Excuse me!

16:15.220 --> 16:16.550
How's Kyosuke?

16:17.260 --> 16:18.320
Mizuki-san.

16:18.760 --> 16:22.820
I'm sorry, if I didn't sprain
my ankle, he wouldn't have...

16:23.100 --> 16:23.530
No, it's not your fault...

16:23.530 --> 16:25.690
No, it's not your fault...
Kyosuke...

16:25.830 --> 16:29.330
He never told me that him and Mizuki
Utsunomiya were costarring together.

16:29.970 --> 16:33.500
And she's calling
Kyosuke with familiarity.

16:34.610 --> 16:35.840
I hate...

16:36.210 --> 16:37.370
...this person!

16:40.220 --> 16:43.180
Are you by any chance Mira?

16:44.520 --> 16:45.140
Yes...

16:48.690 --> 16:51.180
So...you are...

16:52.860 --> 16:54.260
I don't like...

16:54.530 --> 16:56.330
...actress's tear...

17:01.470 --> 17:05.370
Yesterday, Mr. Kyosuke Munakata
was released from the hospital.

17:06.440 --> 17:10.140
There has been a rumor that he got hurt
in place of Ms. Mizuki Utsunomiya...

17:10.280 --> 17:13.270
...so it's been said
that their marriage is near.

17:14.780 --> 17:17.980
Man, all the channels are
talking about the same thing.

17:19.490 --> 17:20.720
Who could it be?

17:26.260 --> 17:27.460
Why is she here?

17:41.040 --> 17:42.910
My father is not home right now.

17:43.040 --> 17:44.240
O-okay...

17:46.880 --> 17:49.680
I came to see you today.

17:52.520 --> 17:54.580
You don't like me...

17:59.060 --> 18:01.760
May I ask what business you have with
me?

18:03.330 --> 18:06.430
I want you to become my son.

18:12.210 --> 18:14.700
What the hell is with this person?

18:15.640 --> 18:16.940
Is it not possible?

18:17.280 --> 18:17.480
Of course that's not possible!

18:17.480 --> 18:20.320
Of course that's not possible!
Meaning she wants to marry Kyosuke?

18:20.320 --> 18:20.820
Meaning she wants to marry Kyosuke?

18:20.820 --> 18:21.920
My father won't allow you to do that.
Meaning she wants to marry Kyosuke?

18:21.920 --> 18:22.940
My father won't allow you to do that.

18:23.820 --> 18:27.810
Well, he said if you are okay
with it, he doesn't mind...

18:29.060 --> 18:32.550
Because I have the right to.

18:34.460 --> 18:36.260
That is a lie!

18:43.640 --> 18:46.840
Why does she say that
she has the right to...

18:46.940 --> 18:49.430
...with that much confidence?

18:52.980 --> 18:56.680
Kyosuke didn't really
agree to marry her, did he?

19:02.790 --> 19:04.520
There's no way...

19:12.630 --> 19:16.300
Papa, that cloud looks like a boat!

19:17.510 --> 19:21.880
Papa likes that one next to it that
looks like a soft serve ice cream.

19:22.580 --> 19:24.840
Don't you want to take a boat and...

19:24.950 --> 19:27.540
...go to another county
far away together?

19:27.650 --> 19:31.020
Papa wants to eat a plum
flavored soft serve ice cream.

19:33.960 --> 19:36.220
Why can't we just be...

19:37.590 --> 19:38.620
...happy?

19:41.630 --> 19:43.030
I'm just...

19:43.630 --> 19:44.930
...tired now.

19:55.510 --> 19:56.340
Mira...

20:12.430 --> 20:13.620
Kyosuke...

20:14.700 --> 20:16.250
Why are you here?

20:28.080 --> 20:29.770
It's telepathy.

20:32.010 --> 20:34.500
The truth is... I looked around for you.

20:34.820 --> 20:37.310
I went everywhere that you might go.

20:38.920 --> 20:42.450
I didn't know what I was
going to do if you were gone...

20:46.960 --> 20:49.830
I was about to cry
if it was a little longer...

20:51.830 --> 20:52.420
Fool...

20:56.170 --> 21:01.440
Even if I disappear, there are
many people who will love you.

21:02.710 --> 21:04.300
You are the fool!

21:04.450 --> 21:07.680
There isn't anybody
who will replace you, Mira!

21:09.880 --> 21:13.180
The only reason for me
to live in this world is you.

21:15.660 --> 21:16.680
Mine is too.

21:23.470 --> 21:26.130
Today, that woman came to our home...

21:26.530 --> 21:28.330
...Mizuki Utsunomiya.

21:28.440 --> 21:29.030
Yeah.

21:29.400 --> 21:31.340
I heard from her.

21:31.440 --> 21:33.840
Are you really going to marry her?

21:34.880 --> 21:35.600
Who is?

21:35.740 --> 21:36.640
Kyosuke...

21:37.610 --> 21:38.440
Why?

21:40.850 --> 21:43.280
Because she came all the way
to our home and...

21:43.390 --> 21:45.550
...asked if I wanted
to become her son...

21:45.620 --> 21:47.920
...saying that she has the right to.

21:49.260 --> 21:52.390
But I made her go away...

21:52.690 --> 21:54.060
I understand...

21:54.500 --> 21:55.590
I'm sorry...

21:56.100 --> 22:00.530
If I think about your happiness,
I don't have the right to do such a thing.

22:01.670 --> 22:05.470
I get it. I should have talked
to you about this a lot earlier.

22:05.670 --> 22:06.300
What?

22:07.840 --> 22:09.810
The secret of your birth...

22:10.410 --> 22:11.540
It's okay.

22:11.910 --> 22:13.240
I know already.

22:13.350 --> 22:14.250
Hmm...

22:15.180 --> 22:17.910
I thought something was
wrong from the other day.

22:22.120 --> 22:23.850
Mizuki Utsunomiya is...

22:24.130 --> 22:25.520
...your mother.

22:26.060 --> 22:26.930
What?

22:27.230 --> 22:30.100
Oh? You just said you knew...

22:32.430 --> 22:34.770
What about how she is my older sister?

22:34.840 --> 22:35.930
No...

22:39.310 --> 22:43.000
Mizuki and l... We lost our parents
when we were young.

22:43.910 --> 22:46.140
We lived just the two of us together.

22:48.920 --> 22:51.280
We used our beauty in a useful way.

22:51.650 --> 22:55.650
And even without parents,
we were living like pretty well off.

